sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Python Simulator (Mac)
    participant M as Mosquitto (VM Telemetry)
    participant T as MS-Telemetry (VM Telemetry)
    participant K as Kafka (VM Kafka)
    participant D as MS-Delivery (VM Delivery)
    participant N as MS-Notification (VM Notif)
    participant G as Gmail API
    participant F as React Frontend (Mac)

    Note over S, F: Flux de Tracking Temps Réel
    S->>M: Publish GPS (MQTT)
    M->>T: Forward Message
    T->>K: Produce to "gps-data-raw"
    K->>D: Consume GPS Data
    D->>D: Update DB & Calculate Status
    
    Note over D, F: Affichage Frontend
    F->>D: Polling / GET /delivery/{id}
    D-->>F: Return Lat/Lon & Status
    F->>F: Update Marker on Map

    Note over D, G: Flux de Notification
    D->>K: Produce to "order-notifications" (Status Change)
    K->>N: Consume Notification
    N->>N: Check Whitelist
    N->>G: Send Email (via OAuth2 Tokens)
    G-->>G: Deliver to Customer